{
  "tier": "malformed",
  "upstreamEndpoint": "/v1/omni/capabilities",
  "scope": "Defensive bodies only: shapes upstream's own projection cannot produce (a profile pointing at another operation's route), because it appends only the routes of the profile's own operation (`entrypoints/openai/serving_capabilities.py:339-359`). They are still valid pydantic, so a proxy, a cache or an older revision can hand them to us. Never treat them as a sample of a real response.",
